  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 801.02 Scope of the Chapter. This chapter shall:\n\n(a) Govern the connection of self-dialing telephone alarms to any receiving agency;\n\n(b) Not relieve a person from fulfilling and complying with any other county, city, or town requirements; and\n\n(c) Not preclude any receiving agency from prescribing requirements not in conflict with the requirements appearing herein.\n\nSource. #2282, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2791, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5068, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6457, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRES: 6-21-97; ss by #6474, eff 3-25-97; ss by #8307, INTERIM, eff 3-25-05, EXPIRES: 9-21-05; ss by #8392, eff 7-22-05; EXPIRED: 7-22-13\n\nNew. #12771, eff 5-2-19",
